MASTER FEATURE CATALOG
Competitive Exam Preparation & EdTech Operating System
Version: 1.0
Date: 15 November 2026
Scope: Complete product functionality, system architecture, workflows and implementation requirements.

This is the consolidated master list for building an education ecosystem combining the strongest publicly observable capabilities of Physics Wallah, ALLEN, Aakash, Unacademy, Infinity Learn, BYJU'S, Vedantu, Embibe, Filo, Testbook, Adda247 and other education platforms.

The scope covers both a single education platform and a multi-institution SaaS ecosystem.
