Final architectural recommendation
Build a Multi-Institution Adaptive Learning & Examination Operating System.

It should combine:
1. A complete student learning ecosystem.
2. A course marketplace.
3. A sophisticated examination engine.
4. An AI-powered academic mentor.
5. A teacher and educator operating system.
6. An institutional management system.
7. A parent monitoring ecosystem.
8. A unified analytics and intelligence engine.
The biggest differentiator should be the integration between all eight systems: every class, quiz, test, assignment, revision session and learning interaction should contribute to a continuously improving student learning profile.

That is the product we should engineer.